<html lang="en">
<%- include("./partials/head.ejs") %>

<body class="public-page">
  <%- include("./partials/nav.ejs") %>

  <main class="home-shell">
    <section class="hero-panel">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO DINEVISTA</p>
        <h1>Comfort food, served with a little more care.</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">Explore a warm, approachable menu built around familiar favorites, fresh ingredients, and the joy of sharing a good meal.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/Login">Log in to order</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/SignUp">Create an account</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-card">
        <span class="hero-card-kicker">TODAY'S MOOD</span>
        <strong>Gather &amp; enjoy.</strong>
        <span>Fresh plates. Relaxed moments. No fuss.</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-grid">
      <article class="content-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">OUR OFFERINGS</p>
        <h2>Something for every table.</h2>
        <p>From juicy burgers and crisp salads to comforting bowls, pizzas, sushi, and desserts, every dish is made to feel familiar, satisfying, and worth coming back for.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card accent-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT DINEVISTA</p>
        <h2>Food brings people together.</h2>
        <p>We built DineVista around a simple idea: great food should feel welcoming. Choose your favorites, build your cart, and enjoy a smoother ordering experience from start to finish.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="home-cta">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">READY TO BROWSE?</p>
        <h2>Your next favorite dish might be one click away.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-light" href="/Menu">View the menu</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
